olors = ['#f43f5e', '#facc15', '#22c55e', '#38bdf8', '#a855f7'];\n            for (let i = 0; i <= 20; i++) {\n                let bx = i * 20;\n                let by = 15 + Math.sin(i * 0.5) * 12;\n                let color = bulbColors[(i + Math.floor(time * 8)) % bulbColors.length];\n                \n                ctx.fillStyle = color;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(bx, by, 3.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function drawRotatingCanopy(angle) {\n            const topY = 90;\n            const segments = 12;\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(centerX, topY - 15);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX, topY - 48);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(centerX + 15, topY - 40, centerX + 28, topY - 48);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(centerX + 15, topY - 30, centerX, topY - 32);\n            ctx.closePath();\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#dc2626';\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#f59e0b';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(centerX, topY - 15);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX, topY - 50);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(centerX, topY - 15);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX - 32, topY + 20);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 32, topY + 20);\n            ctx.closePath();\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#f59e0b';\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < segments; i++) {\n                let segAngle1 = angle + (i * (Math.PI * 2 / segments));\n                let segAngle2 = angle + ((i + 1) * (Math.PI * 2 / segments));\n\n                let x1 = centerX + Math.cos(segAngle1) * (radiusX + 18);\n                let y1 = roofBaseY + Math.sin(segAngle1) * radiusY;\n                let x2 = centerX + Math.cos(segAngle2) * (radiusX + 18);\n                let y2 = roofBaseY + Math.sin(segAngle2) * radiusY;\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(centerX, topY + 15);\n                ctx.lineTo(x1, y1);\n                ctx.lineTo(x2, y2);\n                ctx.closePath();\n\n                ctx.fillStyle = palette[i % palette.length];\n                ctx.fill();\n                ctx.strokeStyle = '#fef08a';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(centerX, roofBaseY + 6, radiusX + 18, radiusY + 4, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#581c87';\n            ctx.fill();\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#fef08a';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n            ctx.stroke();\n        }\n\n        function drawBasePlatform() {\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(centerX, centerY + 20, radiusX + 15, radiusY + 8, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#090d16';\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(centerX, centerY + 10, radiusX + 8, radiusY + 4, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#c2410c';\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(centerX, centerY, radiusX, radiusY, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#0284c7';\n            ctx.fill();\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#fef08a';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n            ctx.stroke();\n        }\n\n        function drawCenterPillar() {\n            const pillarWidth = 32;\n            const pillarTopY = roofBaseY + 6;\n            const pillarBottomY = centerY; \n\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#15803d';\n            ctx.fillRect(centerX - pillarWidth / 2, pillarTopY, pillarWidth, pillarBottomY - pillarTopY);\n\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#fef08a';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 4;\n            for (let y = pillarTopY; y < pillarBottomY; y += 18) {\n                let shiftY = y + ((angleOffset * 22) % 16);\n                if (shiftY >= pillarTopY && shiftY <= pillarBottomY - 4) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(centerX - pillarWidth / 2, shiftY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(centerX + pillarWidth / 2, shiftY + 8);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        function drawHorseWithRider(item, index) {\n            ctx.save();\n            \n            let roofAttachX = item.x;\n            let roofAttachY = roofBaseY + Math.sin(item.angle) * radiusY + 6;\n            let baseAttachX = item.x;\n            let baseAttachY = centerY + Math.sin(item.angle) * radiusY;\n\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#cbd5e1';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3 * item.scale;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(roofAttachX, roofAttachY);\n            ctx.lineTo(baseAttachX, baseAttachY);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            ctx.translate(item.x, item.y);\n            ctx.scale(item.scale, item.scale);\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#d97706';\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(0, 0, 22, 12, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(11, -4);\n            ctx.lineTo(20, -22);\n            ctx.lineTo(26, -17);\n            ctx.lineTo(17, 3);\n            ctx.closePath();\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#b45309';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3.5;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(11, 8); ctx.lineTo(16, 22);\n            ctx.moveTo(7, 8);  ctx.lineTo(10, 22);\n            ctx.moveTo(-11, 8); ctx.lineTo(-16, 22);\n            ctx.moveTo(-7, 8);  ctx.lineTo(-10, 22);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#dc2626';\n            ctx.fillRect(-8, -12, 16, 8);\n\n            let kidColor = kidColors[index % kidColors.length];\n            ctx.fillStyle = kidColor;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.ellipse(0, -18, 7, 10, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fill();\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#fed7aa';\n   